{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["約書亞大祭司"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華又讓我看見約書亞大祭司站在祂的天使面前，撒旦正站在約書亞的右邊控訴他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和華對撒旦說：「撒旦啊，耶和華斥責你！揀選耶路撒冷的耶和華斥責你！這人豈不像從火中抽出來的一根柴嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["那時，約書亞穿著污穢的衣服站在天使面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["天使吩咐在他面前侍立的說：「脫掉他污穢的衣服。」他又對約書亞說：「看啊，我已除掉你的罪，我要給你穿上華美的衣服。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我說：「給他戴上潔淨的禮冠。」他們便給他戴上潔淨的禮冠、穿上華美的衣服。那時，耶和華的天使站在旁邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華的天使告誡約書亞："]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「萬軍之耶和華說，『你若遵行我的道，謹守我的吩咐，便可以管理我的家，看守我的院宇。我必讓你在這些侍立的天使中間自由出入。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["約書亞大祭司啊，你和坐在你面前的同伴們聽著，你們都是將來之事的預兆：我將使我僕人大衛的苗裔興起。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["看啊，這是我在約書亞面前安置的石頭，它有七眼",{"noteId":0},"，我要親自在上面刻字，並在一天之內除掉這地方的罪。這是萬軍之耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["到那天，你們將各自邀請鄰居坐在葡萄樹和無花果樹下。這是萬軍之耶和華說的。』」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「眼」或作「面」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}